{"id":"1734624324342672","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-cardinality.md","title":"Cardinality","display":"df-cardinality — Cardinality","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-cardinality","aliases":["93-df-cardinality"],"display":"df-cardinality — Cardinality","depends_on":["[[93-df-set-theoretic-background]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-cardinality"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-cardinality</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-cardinality — Cardinality"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e30eac382dc7d1a7\" href=\"?note=e30eac382dc7d1a7\" title=\"93-df-set-theoretic-background\">93-df-set-theoretic-background</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y\\in V\">\\(X,Y\\in V\\)</span> are sets and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Set}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Set}_{93}\\)</span> is the set predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e30eac382dc7d1a7\" href=\"?note=e30eac382dc7d1a7\" title=\"93-df-set-theoretic-background\">93-df-set-theoretic-background</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Bij}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Bij}_{93}\\)</span> is the three-place bijection predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e30eac382dc7d1a7\" href=\"?note=e30eac382dc7d1a7\" title=\"93-df-set-theoretic-background\">93-df-set-theoretic-background</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span> is the ambient ordinal predicate and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}\\)</span> is sourced from the set-theoretic background.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CardEq}\">\\(\\mathrm{CardEq}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CardLe}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{CardLe}_{93}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{InfCard}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{InfCard}_{93}\\)</span> are defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cardinality}\\vdash \\mathrm{CardEq}(X,Y)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Set}_{93}(X)\\land\\mathrm{Set}_{93}(Y)\\land\\exists f\\;\\mathrm{Bij}_{93}(f,X,Y)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cardinality}\\vdash \\mathrm{CardEq}(X,Y)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Set}_{93}(X)\\land\\mathrm{Set}_{93}(Y)\\land\\exists f\\;\\mathrm{Bij}_{93}(f,X,Y)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cardinality}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CardLe}_{93}(X,Y)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Set}_{93}(X)\\land\\mathrm{Set}_{93}(Y)\n\\land\\exists f\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{Func}_{93}(f,X,Y)\n\\land\\forall x,x&#39;\\in X\\;(f(x)=f(x&#39;)\\to x=x&#39;)\\Bigr]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cardinality}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CardLe}_{93}(X,Y)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Set}_{93}(X)\\land\\mathrm{Set}_{93}(Y)\n\\land\\exists f\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{Func}_{93}(f,X,Y)\n\\land\\forall x,x&#39;\\in X\\;(f(x)=f(x&#39;)\\to x=x&#39;)\\Bigr]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cardinality}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{InfCard}_{93}(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Ord}(\\kappa)\\land\\neg\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}(\\kappa)\n\\land\\forall\\beta\\in\\kappa\\;\\neg\\mathrm{CardEq}(\\beta,\\kappa)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cardinality}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{InfCard}_{93}(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Ord}(\\kappa)\\land\\neg\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}(\\kappa)\n\\land\\forall\\beta\\in\\kappa\\;\\neg\\mathrm{CardEq}(\\beta,\\kappa)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Equipotence is witnessed by a bijection and cardinal comparison by an injection, both between explicitly supplied sets. This avoids overloading carrier bars with an undeclared cardinal-number operator.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-set-theoretic-background","status":"resolved","id":"e30eac382dc7d1a7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-set-theoretic-background]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-set-theoretic-background","status":"resolved","id":"e30eac382dc7d1a7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X,Y\\in V$ are sets and $\\mathrm{Set}_{93}$ is the set predicate of [[93-df-set-theoretic-background]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-set-theoretic-background","status":"resolved","id":"e30eac382dc7d1a7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Bij}_{93}$ is the three-place bijection predicate of [[93-df-set-theoretic-background]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,Y\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Set}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Bij}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CardEq}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CardLe}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{InfCard}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cardinality}\\vdash \\mathrm{CardEq}(X,Y)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Set}_{93}(X)\\land\\mathrm{Set}_{93}(Y)\\land\\exists f\\;\\mathrm{Bij}_{93}(f,X,Y)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cardinality}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CardLe}_{93}(X,Y)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Set}_{93}(X)\\land\\mathrm{Set}_{93}(Y)\n\\land\\exists f\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{Func}_{93}(f,X,Y)\n\\land\\forall x,x'\\in X\\;(f(x)=f(x')\\to x=x')\\Bigr]","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cardinality}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{InfCard}_{93}(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Ord}(\\kappa)\\land\\neg\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}(\\kappa)\n\\land\\forall\\beta\\in\\kappa\\;\\neg\\mathrm{CardEq}(\\beta,\\kappa)","display":true}],"bytes":1529,"backlinks":[{"id":"a015fcd24d4b916f","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CardEq}$ and $\\mathrm{CardLe}_{93}$ are the equipotence and cardinal-comparison predicates of [[93-df-cardinality]]."},{"id":"2cd98554615471be","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FinAlg}_{93}$, $\\mathrm{CardLe}_{93}$, and $\\mathrm{UltProd}_{93}$ are sourced from [[93-df-finite-algebra]], [[93-df-cardinality]], and [[93-df-ultraproduct]]."},{"id":"f7be4b80a43cd8c3","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CardEq}$ and $\\mathrm{InfCard}_{93}$ are sourced from [[93-df-cardinality]], and $\\mathrm{FOIso}_{93}$ is first-order isomorphism."},{"id":"ffe85e118c37beef","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CardEq}$ and $\\mathrm{CardLe}_{93}$ are sourced from [[93-df-cardinality]]."},{"id":"1c3334bd8714f888","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CardEq}$ and $\\mathrm{CardLe}_{93}$ are the equipotence and cardinal-comparison predicates of [[93-df-cardinality]]."},{"id":"57abb955e28f83aa","anchor":"ref-26","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[93-df-cardinality]]"}],"outgoing":["e30eac382dc7d1a7"]}